        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "libcdio CDRDAO driver, relative `FILE` paths."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "libcdio-paranoia sniffs sample data to guess byte order."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "Paranoia's cache model doubles as its read chunk size."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "`cdio_get_device_fd()` is not in libcdio 2.1.0."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "libcdio does not distinguish \"no CD-TEXT on disc\" from \"driver cannot read CD-TEXT\"."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "EAC's `Pre-gap length` field is hundredths of a second, not CD frames."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "libcdio terminates the process from inside a library call."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "libcdio-paranoia checks the per-frame retry limit only at multiples of 5."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "And with paranoia disabled (`-P 0`), an unreadable sector never returned at any retry limit."
        },
        {
          "name": "cyanrip-fork:local-mitigation",
          "value": "genopt prints its own errors unless you take them."
        },
